<title>CANADA: IMAX Corp signs four new agreements.</title>
<headline>IMAX Corp signs four new agreements.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imax Corp said on Tuesday that it signed four new agreements for up to 13 IMAX 3D theatres with prominent motion picture theatre operators in the United States, Canada and Europe.</p>
<p>IMAX said it formed a joint venture with Viacom Inc's Famous Players Theatres, reached a master license agreement with Paris-based Gaumont Cinemas, and signed agreements with Germany-based Bofiscope UFA and U.S.-based Muvico Entertainment.</p>
<p>The transactions represent a minimum of $25 million in revenues over a five year period, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
